---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Gua Sha | Nikki Leonardi Bodywork Traverse City" description="Instrument-assisted fascial release with gua sha. Breaks down adhesions and restores tissue mobility. Traverse City therapeutic massage.">
  <div class="pt-16">
    <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-[#162040]">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-4">Gua Sha</p>
        <h1 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-5xl text-[#f0f4ff] leading-tight mb-6">Instrument-assisted<br/>fascial release.<br/><em class="text-[#c8a84b]">Breaking down<br/>what's been stuck.</em></h1>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d1428]">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-[#c8a84b]/85 leading-relaxed text-lg">
        <p>Gua sha uses a smooth-edged instrument to work along the surface of the skin, targeting fascial adhesions and restricted tissue just beneath. The technique improves circulation, breaks down scar tissue and adhesions, and restores tissue mobility in a way that manual work alone sometimes cannot reach.</p>
        <p>Like cupping, gua sha is most effective when incorporated into an integrative session where Nikki can assess what the body needs in context.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12">
        <a href="/book" class="btn-primary">Book a Session</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
